compress-pdf (3.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Complete rewrite with GTK 4 and libadwaita.
  * Compress several files at once, with per-file progress and cancel.
  * Four compression levels tuned on real scans.
  * Never makes a file bigger and never overwrites existing files.
  * Clear messages for password-protected, damaged and non-PDF files.

